      "title": "Related work: find it, sort it, ask",
      "description": "Before new work takes shape, find the work it touches. Search work items, issues and open PRs for relevance; categorize and summarize every hit; then ask the user whether and how to coordinate. Judgement decides the categories and the recommendation, and the user decides the coordination. Called by CRDM when a requirement is initiated or updated in chat, and by methodology adoption. Process: processes/process/related-work.bpmn.",
